#! mathcas 2 notebook

#% title
# morlet_wavelet

#% text
# `morlet_wavelet(w0)` is the analytic Morlet wavelet of central frequency w0 (default 6) for `continuous_wavelet_transform`: in frequency pi^(-1/4) exp(-(s w - w0)^2/2) for w > 0 and 0 for w < 0 (Torrence and Compo, 1998, table 1).

#% section
# Examples

#% subsection
# Basic examples

#% cell
c = continuous_wavelet_transform(n(cos(range(64)/2)), morlet_wavelet(), [3, 2])

#% cell
c("Wavelet")
#% output
#= morlet_wavelet(6)

